  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 11711,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "The link to Uber’s privacy policy was using the unencrypted `http://` scheme, making it possible for an attacker with the ability to Man-in-The-Middle (MiTM) traffic. This would allow them to replace normal responses with malicious content such as a phishing page. The content would then render within the Uber application, making for a credible phishing attack.",
